{"id":"wb-5-49","name":"柳孜运河码头遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"柳孜运河码头遗址","text":"柳孜运河遗址位于安徽省淮北市濉溪县百善镇柳孜村，是隋唐大运河通济渠的遗迹。\n2001年，以柳孜运河码头遗址之名列入第五批全国重点文物保护单位。2014年，以柳孜运河遗址之名成为世界遗产——大运河的组成部分。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9F%B3%E5%AD%9C%E8%BF%90%E6%B2%B3%E7%A0%81%E5%A4%B4%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":91394925,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91394925","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/28bd0fea39c783b2e6ac3e45.jpg","title":"20260131_Canal_Site_at_Liuzi_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260131_Canal_Site_at_Liuzi_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/20260131_Canal_Site_at_Liuzi_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​濉溪 柳孜运河遗址","width":320,"height":213}}